@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito66-nouns`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Builders for the test modules.  No rules of law, no assertions.
--
-- L4 has no record update, so each builder takes every field, with a mixfix
-- segment naming each argument at the call site.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Fixtures — builders`

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An item of income from personal exertion`
`a salary of` `the amount` MEANS
    `An item of income from personal exertion` WITH
        `kind`           IS `from employment`
        `taxable amount` IS `the amount`
        `paid in respect of employment income for which the spouse was entitled to a separate calculation` IS FALSE
        `the spouse was entitled to a separate calculation, in the five years before the pension began, for the income by virtue of which it is paid` IS FALSE

GIVEN `the kind`   IS A `Kind of income from personal exertion`
      `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `first`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `second`     IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An item of income from personal exertion`
`income of kind` `the kind` `of` `the amount` `; paid for employment income that qualified:` `first` `; qualified in the five years before:` `second` MEANS
    `An item of income from personal exertion` WITH
        `kind`           IS `the kind`
        `taxable amount` IS `the amount`
        `paid in respect of employment income for which the spouse was entitled to a separate calculation` IS `first`
        `the spouse was entitled to a separate calculation, in the five years before the pension began, for the income by virtue of which it is paid` IS `second`

-- Version 0.2.0: every field, the foreign-worker fact of s 48A included.
GIVEN `the sex`        IS A `Sex`
      `the items`      IS A LIST OF `An item of income from personal exertion`
      `other income`   IS A NUMBER
      `pre-marriage`   IS A NUMBER
      `inherited`      IS A NUMBER
      `claims (a)`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `claims (b)`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `widowed`        IS A BOOLEAN
      `section 37`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `foreign worker` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A spouse`
`a spouse, with the foreign-worker fact:` `the sex` `; income from personal exertion` `the items` `; other income` `other income` `; pre-marriage property income` `pre-marriage` `; inherited property income` `inherited` `; claims under (a)` `claims (a)` `; claims under (b)` `claims (b)` `; widowed before this marriage` `widowed` `; s 37` `section 37` `; a foreign worker within section 48A` `foreign worker` MEANS
    `A spouse` WITH
        `sex`                                            IS `the sex`
        `income from personal exertion`                  IS `the items`
        `taxable income not from personal exertion`      IS `other income`
        `taxable income from property owned one year before the marriage` IS `pre-marriage`
        `taxable income from property inherited during the marriage`      IS `inherited`
        `claims a separate calculation of the tax on income from personal exertion` IS `claims (a)`
        `claims a separate calculation of the tax on the property income in subsection (b)` IS `claims (b)`
        `a widow or widower when the present marriage was contracted` IS `widowed`
        `would be entitled to a credit point under section 37`        IS `section 37`
        `a foreign worker within the meaning of section 48A`          IS `foreign worker`

-- The builder of version 0.1.0, unchanged at the call site: a spouse who is
-- not a foreign worker.  The independent tests (tests-independent.l4) call it.
GIVEN `the sex`        IS A `Sex`
      `the items`      IS A LIST OF `An item of income from personal exertion`
      `other income`   IS A NUMBER
      `pre-marriage`   IS A NUMBER
      `inherited`      IS A NUMBER
      `claims (a)`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `claims (b)`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `widowed`        IS A BOOLEAN
      `section 37`     IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A spouse`
`a spouse:` `the sex` `; income from personal exertion` `the items` `; other income` `other income` `; pre-marriage property income` `pre-marriage` `; inherited property income` `inherited` `; claims under (a)` `claims (a)` `; claims under (b)` `claims (b)` `; widowed before this marriage` `widowed` `; s 37` `section 37` MEANS
    `a spouse, with the foreign-worker fact:` `the sex` `; income from personal exertion` `the items` `; other income` `other income`
        `; pre-marriage property income` `pre-marriage` `; inherited property income` `inherited`
        `; claims under (a)` `claims (a)` `; claims under (b)` `claims (b)` `; widowed before this marriage` `widowed` `; s 37` `section 37`
        `; a foreign worker within section 48A` FALSE

-- A spouse with salary only, nothing else, who may or may not claim.
GIVEN `the sex`   IS A `Sex`
      `salary`    IS A NUMBER
      `claims`    IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A spouse`
`a salaried spouse:` `the sex` `earning` `salary` `; claims under (a)` `claims` MEANS
    `a spouse:` `the sex` `; income from personal exertion` (LIST `a salary of` `salary`) `; other income` 0
        `; pre-marriage property income` 0 `; inherited property income` 0
        `; claims under (a)` `claims` `; claims under (b)` FALSE `; widowed before this marriage` FALSE `; s 37` FALSE

GIVEN `born`        IS A NUMBER
      `of reg`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `of other`    IS A BOOLEAN
      `defers`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `interest`    IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A child, for section 66`
`a child born in tax year` `born` `; of the registered spouse` `of reg` `; of the other spouse` `of other` `; mother defers a point` `defers` `; interest` `interest` MEANS
    `A child, for section 66` WITH
        `tax year of birth`                              IS `born`
        `a child of the registered spouse`               IS `of reg`
        `a child of the spouse who is not the registered spouse` IS `of other`
        `the mother elects to count one birth-year credit point in the following tax year` IS `defers`
        `taxable income from a transparent company`      IS 0
        `taxable income from a real estate investment trust` IS 0
        `taxable income from interest`                   IS `interest`
        `taxable income from capital gain`               IS 0

GIVEN `born` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A child, for section 66`
`a child of both, born in tax year` `born` MEANS
    `a child born in tax year` `born` `; of the registered spouse` TRUE `; of the other spouse` TRUE `; mother defers a point` FALSE `; interest` 0

GIVEN `the year`   IS A NUMBER
      `registered` IS A `A spouse`
      `other`      IS A `A spouse`
      `kids`       IS A LIST OF `A child, for section 66`
      `source`     IS A MAYBE `A common source of income`
GIVETH A `Spouses in a tax year`
`spouses in tax year` `the year` `; registered` `registered` `; other` `other` `; children` `kids` `; common source` `source` MEANS
    `Spouses in a tax year` WITH
        `tax year`                                    IS `the year`
        `the registered spouse`                       IS `registered`
        `the spouse who is not the registered spouse` IS `other`
        `children`                                    IS `kids`
        `common source of income`                     IS `source`

GIVEN `a` IS A BOOLEAN
      `b1` IS A BOOLEAN
      `b2` IS A BOOLEAN
      `home` IS A BOOLEAN
      `permanent` IS A BOOLEAN
      `most` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A common source of income`
`a common source: (a)` `a` `; (b) matching` `b1` `; (b) proportional` `b2` `; at home` `home` `; permanent seat` `permanent` `; most activity at home` `most` MEANS
    `A common source of income` WITH
        `the personal exertion of each spouse is required to produce the income` IS `a`
        `each spouse receives income matching his contribution to producing it`  IS `b1`
        `each spouse's income stands in direct proportion to his contribution`   IS `b2`
        `produced in the spouses' residence`                                     IS `home`
        `the residence serves the common source permanently`                     IS `permanent`
        `most of the activity of the source is carried on in the residence`      IS `most`
